  "title": "1935 Duesenberg SSJ Special Speedster Wins 2026 Pebble Beach Concours d’Elegance Best of Show",
  "summary": "The sun has set on the 75th Pebble Beach Concours d’Elegance. The Sunday event is the grand finale of Monterey Car Week, and the Best of Show award is the grand finale to that grand finale. Fittingly, the 2026 award went to the 1935 Duesenberg SSJ Special Speedster of collector Harry Yeaggy, of Cincinnati, Ohio. […]",
